===== OLMoE-1B-7B(colibri) :: 2-code-python | 15.2s Wanduhr (inkl. Laden)
```python
def quicksort(a):
    if len(a) <= 1:
        return a
    pivot = a[len(a) // 2]
    left = [x for x in a if x < pivot]
    middle = [x for x in a if x == pivot]
    right = [x for x in a if x > pivot]
    return quicksort(left) + middle + quicksort(right)
```

